4,1,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think we should be careful about the gallery's condition. Maybe we should check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays first?,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Those are practical concerns, Daisuke. However, I believe we should also consider why people actually visit. I suggest we look into the five years of visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts across ten seasons.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I think we should check who is actually working! Can we look at the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog? We can't have a great show if everyone is too tired!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I agree with everyone! But we should also make sure the art actually arrives on time. Can we check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the loan transport costs over three seasons?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are all quite thorough. However, to avoid any unpleasant surprises when the invoices arrive, I suggest we also examine the mount-making charges and joiner's rate, as well as the evening hire bookings in the gallery.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I see. Everyone has a point. I just worry that if we pick something too heavy or complex, the building might not handle it. Is it okay if I stick with the structural survey and maintenance log?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"That is perfectly fine. I simply believe that a successful exhibition is measured by the public's response, not just the curator's vision. I will proceed with the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll stick with my choices! If the people doing the work are overwhelmed, the whole thing will be a mess. I'm definitely looking into the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you, Rin! It's all about teamwork. I'll stick with the lender paperwork and transport costs. I just want to make sure we don't have to apologize to visitors because the art is missing!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A very pragmatic approach from everyone. I shall maintain my focus on the mount-making charges and evening hire bookings. It would be a pity to discover our budget has vanished into the woodwork, wouldn't it?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I guess we've all decided then. I'll just... do my best to see if the gallery can actually support the next exhibition. I don't want anything to break.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is a reasonable division of labor. By analyzing the historical data of visitor behavior, I hope to provide a perspective that ensures the exhibition is truly desired by the public.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! I'll find out if the grown-ups are working too hard. If the lab is super backed up, we have to pick something easy to set up! Let's go!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! I'll dig into those shipping records. Let's make sure everything arrives safely and on time so we can have an awesome show without any stress!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Let us proceed with this division of labor. I look forward to seeing how our various concerns align—or clash—once the data reveals where the money and effort truly go.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope the results aren't too worrying. I'll go check the records now. Thank you for listening to me.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let us be objective. The data will tell us the truth, regardless of our hopes. I will begin my review of the visitor records now.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm going too! I'm going to be a super-detective and find out if the staff are exhausted! See you all soon! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm on it! I'll find out exactly where the delivery hiccups happened in the past. Let's make sure this next exhibition is a total success! See you guys later!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Until then. I shall see if our financial leaks are as imaginative as our curators. I wish you all a most illuminating search.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
